    "title": "Fill Up Fridge\uff1aOrganizing Game",
    "description": "Fill Up Fridge is a strategy organization game. When you get home from a big purchase, the first thing you do is a restock and shopping sort to organize your refrigerator! Start restock the fridge with different objects, such as: beef\ud83e\udd69, chicken\ud83c\udf57, cheese\ud83e\uddc0, milk\ud83e\udd5b, cola\ud83e\udd64, etc. \r\n\r\nEmpty your shopping basket one by one, and arrange the placement of items of different sizes and heights in the frigidaire reasonably. A good fridge restock strategy can allow you to put more things in the limited space of the refrigerator! \ud83e\uddd0\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddca Game Features:\r\n1. FREE to enjoy this organizer game.\r\n2. The most relaxing satisfying games.\r\n3. Unlock more fridge organizing spaces to fill more items.\r\n4. Various of groceries, beverages and Ingredients.\r\n5. Nice cozy games asmr experience with wonderful visual effects.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhere are the ocd games enthusiasts? Who is the best fridge organizer? I dare say it's definitely you! \r\nEnjoy our Fill Up Fridge which is one of the coolest organization games with your family and friends now.\ud83e\udd70",
